cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Soil protection across scales"
version: 2.0
license: "CC-BY"
type: software
abstract: "This repository contains the scripts, input and output for the comparison of soil diversity and functioning estimates in protected and unprotected sampling sites across three spatial scales (global, continental: Europe, regional: North-Portugal)."
